<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#142238"><title>Report a lost item | Sherubtse Lost &amp; Found</title><link rel="icon" href="/Sherubtse_logo/images.jpg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><script src="/js/app.js" defer></script></head><body><%- include('partials/navbar') %><main class="page-main form-page"><section class="form-intro"><span class="eyebrow eyebrow-dark">Lost item report</span><h1>Tell us what went missing.</h1><p>Include details that help someone recognise it. Do not publish passwords or sensitive account information.</p></section><form id="item-form" class="report-panel"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="lost"><div class="form-two"><label>Item name<input name="title" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Blue water bottle" required></label><label>Category<select name="category" required><option value="">Choose a category</option><option>Electronics</option><option>ID cards &amp; wallets</option><option>Bags</option><option>Books &amp; notes</option><option>Keys</option><option>Clothing</option><option>Sports equipment</option><option>Other</option></select></label></div><label>Description<textarea name="description" required rows="4" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Colour, brand, distinctive details, or contents"></textarea></label><div class="form-two"><label>Last seen at<input name="location" maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Library, Academic Block" required></label><div class="date-field"><label for="lost-date-display">Date lost</label><div class="date-control" data-date-format="dmy"><input id="lost-date-display" data-date-display type="text" placeholder="DD/MM/YYYY" maxlength="10" pattern="[0-9]{2}/[0-9]{2}/[0-9]{4}" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="lost-date-help" required><span class="date-picker-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M16 3v4M8 3v4M3 11h18"/></svg></span><input id="lost-date-picker" name="itemDate" class="date-native" type="date" aria-label="Choose date lost from calendar"></div><small id="lost-date-help">DD/MM/YYYY &middot; Type a date or use the calendar.</small></div></div><label class="file-field">Add a photo (optional)<input name="photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"><small>JPG, PNG, or WebP, up to 30 MB.</small></label><label class="check-line"><input name="phonePublic" type="checkbox" required><span>I understand that my phone number will be shown publicly on this listing (required).</span></label><p class="form-notice">Your name and course are shown with the listing. Phone sharing is required for new posts. Your registered phone number will be visible to anyone browsing this listing. Your college email is visible to signed-in students.</p><button class="button button-navy" type="submit">Post lost item <span>→</span></button><p class="form-message" id="form-message" role="status"></p></form></main><%- include('partials/footer') %></body></html>
